#: ../../source/datasets/catalog/practiceanatomy.md:3
#: c28660ddd8ed4237a290e459e94ccb66
msgid ""
"Practice Anatomy 是 Masaryk 大学自适应学习研究组在 practiceanatomy.com "
"上收集的人体解剖学术语练习数据，静态快照覆盖 2015 年 11 月 16 日至 2017 年 1 月 3 日。"
msgstr ""
"Practice Anatomy is a human anatomy terminology practice dataset "
"collected by the Adaptive Learning Research Group at Masaryk University "
"on practiceanatomy.com, with a static snapshot covering November 16, 2015"
" to January 3, 2017."

